 * Employee `manager` must be an existing employee and must not create a reporting loop → else 400.
   Deleting an employee who has claims, decided claims or reports → 409.
 * The detail page's `data-field` elements cover the record's fields; the `id` is shown in the heading.
+* Cost centres (migration `0002_cost_centres` creates ENG/SAL/FIN/TRV and charges every existing
+  claim to its employee's department's cost centre, falling back to 1/ENG for a department without
+  one). `committed` = approved + paid amounts, `remaining` = `budget - committed`, both rounded to the
+  cent. Approval is refused (409) when the new `committed` would exceed `budget` to the cent;
+  equal is allowed. A PATCH whose valid `budget` is below `committed` is 409 even if other fields
+  are invalid (409 beats 400). A non-null `department` must be non-blank text.
+* A claim created without `cost_centre` by an employee whose department has no cost centre → 400
+  (`cost_centre` field): every claim must be charged to one. The claim create form's empty option
+  means "my department's cost centre".
 * Invalid `X-Now` → 400. Routing errors map to `not_found` (404) or `method_not_allowed` (405).
